title: Remove deprecated RelaychainBlockNumberProvider type alias
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    ## Summary

    Removes the deprecated `RelaychainBlockNumberProvider` type alias from `cumulus-pallet-parachain-system`. All usages already use `RelaychainDataProvider`.

    Part of #11561.
